    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aWarSpirit Recast\u300bis a space top-down shooter roguelike game made by me.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Countless Items, Free Construction]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machines with diverse effects, and hundreds of weapons and items. Various combinations will trigger wonderful chemical reactions, boasting infinite construction possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/a6cc3d8c93d91009c73aa155d4a1a5a0.avif?t=1755672924\" width=1506 height=660 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your spaceship with high freedom and build an invincible battleship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/99b047d2cd1cfd8a469d65acd121e595.poster.avif?t=1755672924\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/99b047d2cd1cfd8a469d65acd121e595.webm?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/99b047d2cd1cfd8a469d65acd121e595.mp4?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Combat]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are all kinds of bizarre spaceship abilities. Fight by combining various spaceship mechanisms and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/cebbd8bd6023a03e9ab821dfd40cb571.poster.avif?t=1755672924\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/cebbd8bd6023a03e9ab821dfd40cb571.webm?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/cebbd8bd6023a03e9ab821dfd40cb571.mp4?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/6460dbded10f4c4177d28a61871ed712.poster.avif?t=1755672924\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/6460dbded10f4c4177d28a61871ed712.webm?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/6460dbded10f4c4177d28a61871ed712.mp4?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/c3afe4d3e124cb0c97e22fe3b13b469a.poster.avif?t=1755672924\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/c3afe4d3e124cb0c97e22fe3b13b469a.webm?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/c3afe4d3e124cb0c97e22fe3b13b469a.mp4?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Freely Modify Attributes]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your spaceship's attributes according to your construction. Not only can you increase your spaceship's attributes, but reducing one of its attributes may also bring unexpected effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/9c84bdd86a8f9647a34983f9b594d332.avif?t=1755672924\" width=1554 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Powerful Bloodline System]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The random bloodline system further strengthens your spaceship, endowing it with endless changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/72646d64c4f3da18ec75df86ddfbd5b9.avif?t=1755672924\" width=1302 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 25 levels and an endless mode. It is a roguelike game with numerous ships and items, well worth playing repeatedly.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aWarSpirit Recast\u300bis a space top-down shooter roguelike game made by me.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Countless Items, Free Construction]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machines with diverse effects, and hundreds of weapons and items. Various combinations will trigger wonderful chemical reactions, boasting infinite construction possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/a6cc3d8c93d91009c73aa155d4a1a5a0.avif?t=1755672924\" width=1506 height=660 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your spaceship with high freedom and build an invincible battleship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/99b047d2cd1cfd8a469d65acd121e595.poster.avif?t=1755672924\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/99b047d2cd1cfd8a469d65acd121e595.webm?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/99b047d2cd1cfd8a469d65acd121e595.mp4?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Combat]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are all kinds of bizarre spaceship abilities. Fight by combining various spaceship mechanisms and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/cebbd8bd6023a03e9ab821dfd40cb571.poster.avif?t=1755672924\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/cebbd8bd6023a03e9ab821dfd40cb571.webm?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/cebbd8bd6023a03e9ab821dfd40cb571.mp4?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/6460dbded10f4c4177d28a61871ed712.poster.avif?t=1755672924\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/6460dbded10f4c4177d28a61871ed712.webm?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/6460dbded10f4c4177d28a61871ed712.mp4?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/c3afe4d3e124cb0c97e22fe3b13b469a.poster.avif?t=1755672924\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/c3afe4d3e124cb0c97e22fe3b13b469a.webm?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/c3afe4d3e124cb0c97e22fe3b13b469a.mp4?t=1755672924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Freely Modify Attributes]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your spaceship's attributes according to your construction. Not only can you increase your spaceship's attributes, but reducing one of its attributes may also bring unexpected effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/9c84bdd86a8f9647a34983f9b594d332.avif?t=1755672924\" width=1554 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Powerful Bloodline System]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The random bloodline system further strengthens your spaceship, endowing it with endless changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780790/extras/72646d64c4f3da18ec75df86ddfbd5b9.avif?t=1755672924\" width=1302 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 25 levels and an endless mode. It is a roguelike game with numerous ships and items, well worth playing repeatedly.</p>",
